IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q10-BATCH-RECONCILE.
*> Compares observed record count & total with trailer values.
*> Tests: both match, count mismatch, amount mismatch, empty.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-N                PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-IDX              PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-TXN-ID           PIC X(10).
01  WS-TXN-AMT          PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01  WS-OBS-COUNT        PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-OBS-TOTAL        PIC 9(11) VALUE 0.
01  WS-EXP-COUNT        PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-EXP-TOTAL        PIC 9(11) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-N

    PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-N
        ACCEPT WS-TXN-ID
        ACCEPT WS-TXN-AMT
        ADD 1 TO WS-OBS-COUNT
        ADD WS-TXN-AMT TO WS-OBS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM

    ACCEPT WS-EXP-COUNT
    ACCEPT WS-EXP-TOTAL

    DISPLAY "OBSERVED COUNT: " WS-OBS-COUNT
    DISPLAY "OBSERVED TOTAL: " WS-OBS-TOTAL

    IF WS-OBS-COUNT = WS-EXP-COUNT
        DISPLAY "COUNT STATUS:  MATCH"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "COUNT STATUS:  MISMATCH"
    END-IF

    IF WS-OBS-TOTAL = WS-EXP-TOTAL
        DISPLAY "AMOUNT STATUS: MATCH"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "AMOUNT STATUS: MISMATCH"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
